<title>NEW ZEALAND: RUGBY LEAGUE-NEW ZEALAND BEAT BRITAIN 17-12 IN FIRST TEST.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-NEW ZEALAND BEAT BRITAIN 17-12 IN FIRST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND, New Zealand 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand beat</p>
<p>Britain 17-12 (halftime 2-10) in the first test on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>New Zealand - Tries: John Timu (2). Goals: Matthew Ridge</p>
<p>(4). Field goal: Ridge.</p>
<p>Britain - Tries: Alan Hunte, Denis Betts. Goals: Bobbie</p>
<p>Goulding (2).</p>
</text>
